{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "BACKFIRE",
    "steam_appid": 3392590,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/eb14e2f3920b7934445dd1a1ca806eed.poster.avif?t=1755203227\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/eb14e2f3920b7934445dd1a1ca806eed.webm?t=1755203227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Nine deadly weapons with one thing in common\u2013 they all fire backward. Mastering each weapon's quirks is the key to combat. Jet around with the flamethrower, master the kick of the shotgun, kill at a distance with the sniper rifle. Whatever you choose, fire with purpose, or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/06f50d6c48bddbfaa10255205feb5207.poster.avif?t=1755203227\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/06f50d6c48bddbfaa10255205feb5207.webm?t=1755203227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They crawl, lunge, and swarm. Grotesque enemies and their sinister overlords. Learn their patterns and perfect your positioning for maximum carnage. Fail and be pulled into madness. They don\u2019t want to kill you... they want to keep you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/1b0fec77ebc5398988da831d4d286e02.poster.avif?t=1755203227\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/1b0fec77ebc5398988da831d4d286e02.webm?t=1755203227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each descent is a fleeting ten-minutes of chaos. The souls you collect... are eternal. Use them to unlock powerful upgrades for your ship, evolving your arsenal and abilities. Die, upgrade, repeat. Come back stronger, or not at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/eb14e2f3920b7934445dd1a1ca806eed.poster.avif?t=1755203227\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/eb14e2f3920b7934445dd1a1ca806eed.webm?t=1755203227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Nine deadly weapons with one thing in common\u2013 they all fire backward. Mastering each weapon's quirks is the key to combat. Jet around with the flamethrower, master the kick of the shotgun, kill at a distance with the sniper rifle. Whatever you choose, fire with purpose, or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/06f50d6c48bddbfaa10255205feb5207.poster.avif?t=1755203227\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/06f50d6c48bddbfaa10255205feb5207.webm?t=1755203227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They crawl, lunge, and swarm. Grotesque enemies and their sinister overlords. Learn their patterns and perfect your positioning for maximum carnage. Fail and be pulled into madness. They don\u2019t want to kill you... they want to keep you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/1b0fec77ebc5398988da831d4d286e02.poster.avif?t=1755203227\" width=720 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392590/extras/1b0fec77ebc5398988da831d4d286e02.webm?t=1755203227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each descent is a fleeting ten-minutes of chaos. The souls you collect... are eternal. Use them to unlock powerful upgrades for your ship, evolving your arsenal and abilities. Die, upgrade, repeat. Come back stronger, or not at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "A fast paced arcade shooter with a sinister twist\u2013 your weapons fire backwards. Descend into a cursed arcade machine, engage in intense combat, and die to demented bosses. Upgrade your power after each attempt until you are strong enough to prevail. Now reborn for PC.",
